    save system resources.

    `GLib.Cache` uses keys and values. A `GLib.Cache` key describes the properties
    of a particular resource. A `GLib.Cache` value is the actual resource.

    `GLib.Cache` has been marked as deprecated, since this API is rarely
    used and not very actively maintained.

