        - `%S`: the second as a decimal number (range 00 to 60)
        - `%t`: a tab character
        - `%T`: the time in 24-hour notation with seconds (`%H:%M:%S`)
        - `%u`: the ISO 8601 standard day of the week as a decimal, range 1 to 7,
