        Args:
            offset: The offset in bytes from the position specified by type
            type: a GLib.SeekType. The type GLib.SeekType.CUR is only allowed in those
                cases where a call to GLib.IOChannel.set_encoding()
                is allowed. See the documentation for
                GLib.IOChannel.set_encoding() for details.

