        internal buffers have been flushed. Newly created channels or
        channels which have returned GLib.IOStatus.EOF
        not require such a flush. For write-only channels, a call to
        GLib.IOChannel.flush() is sufficient. For all other channels,
        the buffers may be flushed by a call to GLib.IOChannel.seek_position().
